        "2025-08-19T08:57:55.257Z1ddpobd": "# Markdown Basic Syntax\n---\nText formatting: **Bold**, *Italic*, ***Bold&Italic***, ~~Deleted~~, \n```\ncode block\n```\n\n> Quote\n>\n>> Nested quote\n\n- Bullet point\n\n1. Ordered\n2. Lists\n   1. with indent\n   4. capabilites\n3. Emojis are supported 😁"
