      "name": "Tables",
      "templateId": "FeatureTemplate",
      "data": {
        "2025-08-19T08:57:55.257Z1ddpobd": "While tables can be used in templates combining multiple *Table header* field types, It is also possible to include simple tables directly in markdown fields like this:\n\n| Name | Role | Location |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Alice | Engineer | Milan |\n| Bob | Designer | Rome |\n| Carla | Manager | Turin |",
