        "mugzhuz5-k45woa2kl": "# Embed example\n---\n\nSites that support embedding can be included in a node with the embed field type. This allows to add videos from online platforms, documents from online office suites, and many other possibilities.\n\nMany sites block standard URLs from being embedded. Please ensure you use the site's specifically provided \"Embed\" or \"Publish to Web\" URL.\n\nYouTube links can be pasted directly and will be auto-converted in the proper format."
